              <p>
                All facility layouts, User Requirement Specifications (URS), and project parameters submitted through our quotation or contact forms are treated with strict confidentiality under non-disclosure standards. Bilateral non-disclosure agreements (NDAs) are routinely executed prior to comprehensive facility engineering audits.
              </p>
            </div>

